{% endif %}## Parallel tool calling in agent loops

When the next independent reads or checks are only implied by the task, list what you need next, then request every item that does not depend on another's result in one response.

## Stacked pull requests

Run `gh stack list` to see the stack. Use `/gh-stack` to work with GitHub Stack.

## Machine-local facts

Put machine-specific context (local clone paths, internal URLs, credentials location) in `CLAUDE.local.md`. It is ignored by git; Codex reads it as `AGENTS.override.md`.

## This project comes from a template

`.copier-answers.yml` records the whetstone version this project was generated from. Files
that came from the template (tooling config, `.claude/`, `.codex/`, CI) take fixes through
the template: change `zaffnet/whetstone`, release a version, then run `uvx copier update`
here and commit. Project code and docs are edited here as usual.
